{
  "terms": "<p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial; color: rgb(0, 29, 53);\">Terms and conditions, often called terms of service or terms of use, are a legally binding agreement between a service provider and its users, outlining the rules and guidelines for using a website, app, or other service.&nbsp;They define the rights and responsibilities of both parties, ensuring clarity and setting expectations for the relationship.</span></p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Welcome to Seen Hub! By booking a space, joining as a member, or attending an event, you agree to the following guidelines:</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1. Bookings &amp; Payments</h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">All bookings must be made through Seen Hub’s website or official booking system.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Payments are required at the time of booking unless otherwise agreed (e.g., corporate clients).</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Once confirmed, you’ll receive a QR/barcode for entry. Please keep it safe.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2. Types of Events</h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">a) In-House Events (Hosted by Seen Hub):</strong></p><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Organized and managed directly by Seen Hub.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Tickets/registrations are handled by Seen Hub.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub is responsible for event setup, content, and experience.</li></ul><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">b) External Events (Hosted by External Organizers):</strong></p><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Companies or individuals may rent Seen Hub’s space for their own events.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub provides the venue and facilities only.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">The external organizer is fully responsible for event content, compliance with UAE law, and guest experience.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">3. Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">In-House Events:</strong></p><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Cancel up to <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">48 hours before</strong> = full refund.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Cancel between <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">24–48 hours before</strong> = 50% refund.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Cancel less than <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">24 hours before</strong> = no refund.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">If Seen Hub cancels, guests receive a full refund or credit.</li></ul><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">External Events (Space Rentals):</strong></p><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Cancel up to <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">7 days before</strong> = 50% refund.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Cancel less than <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">7 days before</strong> = no refund.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Failure to comply with Seen Hub policies or UAE law may result in cancellation without refund.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub is not responsible for refunds of tickets sold by external organizers.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">4. Facilities &amp; Services</h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Reading Zone:</strong> Books are for on-site use only. Taking books outside Seen Hub is not permitted unless prior arrangement is made with management.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Printing Services:</strong> Paid printing/copying services are available. Misuse (e.g., illegal or harmful content) is not allowed.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Lockers:</strong> Paid, automated lockers are available for rent. Users are responsible for locking their lockers; Seen Hub is not liable for lost or stolen items.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">5. Community Guidelines &amp; Conduct</h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub is a community-first space. Respect others and maintain a positive, professional environment.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Disruptive, offensive, or harmful behavior will not be tolerated.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub reserves the right to suspend or terminate a membership, day pass, or access <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">without refund</strong> if community guidelines are not followed.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">6. Liability</h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub is not responsible for personal belongings.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">For external events, the organizer is fully responsible for safety, compliance, and guest experience.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">For in-house events, Seen Hub ensures safety and quality within reasonable standards.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">7. Companies &amp; Corporate Clients</h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Corporate or long-term agreements are covered by <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">separate contracts</strong> between Seen Hub and the company.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">The website Terms &amp; Conditions apply only to individual bookings, day passes, and memberships.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">8. Changes to Terms</h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Seen Hub may update these terms from time to time. The latest version will always be published on our website.</li></ul>",
  "privacy": "<p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">At Seen Hub, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring transparency in how your information is collected and used.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">1. Information We Collect</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We may collect the following types of information:</p><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, and phone number when you make a booking or contact us.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: 