top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">To improve our website, services, and customer experience.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">3. Sharing of Information</strong></h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">We do <strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">not</strong> sell or rent your personal information.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Information may be shared only with trusted third-party service providers (e.g., payment processors, analytics, IT support).</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">We may disclose information if required by applicable UAE laws or regulations.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">4. Data Security</strong></h3><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Payment information is handled exclusively by secure and certified payment providers.</li></ul><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">5. Your Rights</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">You have the right to:</p><ul style=\"margin: 0px 1.5em 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; list-style: disc; cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Request access to your personal data.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Request corrections or updates.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Request deletion of your data, subject to legal requirements.</li><li style=\"margin: initial; padding-top: initial; padding-right: initial; padding-bottom: initial; padding-left: 1.5em; text-align: initial; list-style: none;\">Unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time.</li></ul><h2 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Workspace Booking Policy</strong></h2><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To ensure smooth operations and fair usage of our facilities, the following terms apply to all workspace bookings:</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">1. Direct Bookings Only</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">All bookings must be made directly through Seen Hub management or the official booking system. Third-party or unauthorized bookings will not be accepted.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">2. Authorized Use</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Only the individual or company that made the booking may use the reserved space. Subletting, transferring, or sharing without prior approval is strictly prohibited.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">3. Usage Responsibility</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The booking party is fully responsible for any damage, misuse, or violation of rules during the booking period.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">4. Access Control</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Access to facilities is limited to registered individuals under the confirmed booking.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">5. Compliance with Rules</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">All users must adhere to guidelines regarding behavior, cleanliness, noise levels, and proper use of equipment.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">6. Management Rights</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Seen Hub reserves the right to cancel or refuse bookings that violate these terms without prior notice.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">7. No Third-Party Commission Policy</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Seen Hub does not engage in commission-based or third-party brokerage for bookings. Any such claims are considered unauthorized.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">8. Attendance, Freeze &amp; No-Refund Policy</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If a user books a workspace (coworking area or private space) and does not attend, no refund will be provided.</p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\"></p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hourly Bookings: Non-refundable once confirmed.</p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Daily Bookings: Non-refundable if unused.</p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Weekly Bookings: May be frozen for up to 2 days, subject to management approval.</p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Monthly Bookings: May be frozen for up to 7 days, subject to management approval.</p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\"></p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">All freeze requests must be communicated in advance and are subject to approval. No refunds will be issued under any circumstances after booking confirmation.</p><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\"></p><h2 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Additional Policies</strong></h2><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Food Policy</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bringing outside food or beverages is not permitted unless explicitly approved by management.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">Personal Belongings</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Seen Hub is not responsible for any loss, theft, or damage to personal belongings within the premises.</p><h3 style=\"cursor: text; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"margin: initial; padding: initial; text-align: initial;\">No Smoking Policy</strong></h3><p style=\"cursor: text; margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: initial; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Smoking is strictly prohibited within the premises in accordance with applicable UAE laws and regulations.</p>",
  "copyrights": "<p data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"151\">© 2026 Seen Hub. All Rights Reserved.</p>\n<p data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"472\">All materials displayed on this website, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, icons, images, videos, designs, layouts, documents, and digital content, are the exclusive property of Seen Hub and are protected under applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"646\">No content from this website may be copied, reproduced, republished, uploaded, transmitted, distributed, or used in any form without prior written permission from Seen Hub.</p>\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"784\">Unauthorized use of any content may result in legal action under applicable copyright, trademark, and intellectual property regulations.</p>\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"892\">Seen Hub reserves the right to modify, update, or remove website content at any time without prior notice.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d0jpe1\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"916\">Contact Information</h2>\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1052\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"930\">Seen Hub</strong><br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\">\nAl Ain, UAE<br data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\">\nEmail: <a data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"980\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\">info@seenhub.ae</a></p>"
